        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「カミーユ、大丈夫か？！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "greek_merchant",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「……。ふむ、面倒だ。それでは、我々商隊と物品は先に国に帰るとするか…。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "thief",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「俺を見捨てるのか！？」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「こいつら……仲間じゃなかったのか？」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "greek_merchant",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「ただの使い捨てだ。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（銀のペンダントを見る）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "greek_merchant",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「この程度の品のために、随分騒がせてくれたものだ。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（商人はペンダントを主人公たちへ投げる）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "greek_merchant",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「返してやろう。我々には、もっと価値のある取引がある。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_thief_caught.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「待て！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（船へ乗り込む）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "greek_merchant",
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「Adieu.」",
          "learningPoint": {
            "title": "Adieu",
            "text": "意味: 「さようなら」\n日常会話で使われる Au revoir (またね) とは異なり、長い別れや、二度と会わないような相手に対して使う重い別れの表現です。"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（船が港を離れる）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「……。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_camille_cry.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "「ひっく...ひっく....ごわがっだよおおおおおおーーーーーー！！！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "appear",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「君たちっ！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "appear",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "（走ってくる女将さん）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "appear",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「無事で良かった……！ 小さな君たちが泥棒を追いかけて行くものだから、心配で心配で…！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "police",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「Merci, petits héros. 君たちのおかげで泥棒は確保できたよ。」",
          "learningPoint": {
            "title": "petits héros",
            "text": "意味: 「小さなヒーローたち」\n● petits: 「小さな」の複数形\n● héros: 「ヒーロー・勇者」"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "smile",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「本当にありがとう。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "smile",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「いや……僕は何も……。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "normal",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「そちらの女の子もありがとう。Vous êtes très courageux.」",
          "learningPoint": {
            "title": "Vous êtes très courageux",
            "text": "意味: 「君たちはとても勇敢だ」\n● Vous: あなたたち（主語）\n● êtes: 動詞 être（〜である）の vous に対する変化形\n● très: とても\n● courageux: 勇敢な（男性複数形）"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "camille",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「えへへ…」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "determined",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「Ah, j’y pense ! お礼に、私のレストランへご招待させて！ 今日はもう日が暮れてしまうから、三日後ご家族といらっしゃい。場所はこのカードに記してあるから。」",
          "learningPoint": {
            "title": "Ah, j’y pense !",
            "text": "意味: 「あ、そうだ！」「思い出した！」\n会話中に突然何かアイデアや思い出したことを提案するときに使う日常の慣用句です。"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "determined",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「そんな、いいんですか！？」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_port.webp",
          "character": "camille",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "determined",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "determined",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「やったー！！ そうと決まれば早く帰って報告しなくちゃね！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bgBlack",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（無事帰宅）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_market.webp",
          "character": "father",
          "expression": "default",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「いやーそれにしても、付き添いは俺だけで良かったのかな！？ なんと贅沢な」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_market.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "father",
              "expression": "default",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「母さんもカミーユの家族もちょうど仕事だったしね。皆、父さんみたいに暇じゃないんだよ」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_market.webp",
          "character": "father",
          "expression": "sorry",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「痛い！！息子のとげある言葉が痛い！！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "normal",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「Bienvenue ～ (ようこそ)！！ 来てくれたのね、小さなヒーローさんたち！！……って」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "father",
              "expression": "default",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "proprietress",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "女将・父：「「ええええええええええええええ」」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "camille",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "father",
              "expression": "default",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「何々～知り合い？知り合い？？」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "worried",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「以前こちらの方がご来店されたときに、うちの『ブイヤベースがうますぎるっ』ってレシピを懇願されてねぇ…。流石にレシピすべては教えられないから、隠し味だけ教えたらルンルンと帰られたのよ」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": null,
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "camille",
              "expression": "normal",
              "position": "left"
            },
            {
              "id": "father",
              "expression": "default",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "（子供たちのジト目）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "father",
          "expression": "sorry",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「まーなんだ…。その節はどうも本当にありがとうございました…。」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "hero",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "father",
              "expression": "sorry",
              "position": "right"
            }
          ],
          "text": "「先にあやまれいッッ！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bgBlack",
          "shake": true,
          "characters": [],
          "text": "（どたばた！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "background": "bg_restaurant.webp",
          "character": "proprietress",
          "expression": "smile",
          "position": "right",
          "text": "「でもまぁ料理人冥利に尽きるというものよね。さてじゃあ、料理を出す前に、最後の試験よ！！」"
        },
        {
          "type": "tutorial",
